      <species id="mw1ef278bd_7285_42ce_a22a_3933722aa48e" name="qPSC" compartment="mw026862eb_87b1_405a_b373_64e65f51ca39" initialAmount="0" substanceUnits="MWUSERUNIT_cell" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="true" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Quiescent pancreatic stellate cells in tumor compartment. In normal pancreas, PSCs store vitamin A and maintain stromal homeostasis.</body>
        </notes>
      </species>
      <species id="mw4fe7a3d7_34c3_4579_9003_6fe425f58ffa" name="iCAF" compartment="mw026862eb_87b1_405a_b373_64e65f51ca39" initialAmount="0" substanceUnits="MWUSERUNIT_cell" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="true" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Inflammatory cancer-associated fibroblasts. Secrete IL-6 and CCL5, driving MDSC recruitment and M2 polarization. Driven by tumor-derived IL-1alpha; TGFb antagonizes via IL-1R1 repression.</body>
        </notes>
      </species>
      <species id="mwf05b69e3_55d7_4016_97f6_407c2a513dec" name="myCAF" compartment="mw026862eb_87b1_405a_b373_64e65f51ca39" initialAmount="0" substanceUnits="MWUSERUNIT_cell" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="true" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Myofibroblastic cancer-associated fibroblasts. Secrete ECM, CXCL12, TGFb, VEGF. Build desmoplastic barrier. Favored by TGFb signaling (Biffi 2019).</body>
        </notes>
      </species>
      <species id="mwcbc45f24_ad48_4a24_ab02_50259ec82953" name="apCAF" compartment="mw026862eb_87b1_405a_b373_64e65f51ca39" initialAmount="0" substanceUnits="MWUSERUNIT_cell" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="true" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Antigen-presenting cancer-associated fibroblasts. Express MHC-II, present tumor antigen tolerogenically -&gt; Treg induction. Rarest subtype ~2-5% of CAFs (Elyada 2019).</body>
        </notes>
      </species>
      <species id="mwb2c823f0_d234_4311_b745_563173da9d17" name="collagen" compartment="mw026862eb_87b1_405a_b373_64e65f51ca39" initialAmount="0" substanceUnits="MWBUILTINPREFIX_milli_MWBUILTINUNIT_gram" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="true" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Fibrillar collagen (types I/III) in tumor (total mass in mg). Primary structural ECM component driving desmoplasia. Determines pore size (immune exclusion) and stiffness (mechanotransduction).</body>
        </notes>
      </species>
      <species id="mw811deae6_7c5d_435d_8546_24e24cb4ea5e" name="CXCL12" compartment="mw026862eb_87b1_405a_b373_64e65f51ca39" initialConcentration="0" substanceUnits="MWDERIVEDUNIT_nanomolarity_milliliter" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="false" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">CXCL12/SDF-1 chemokine secreted by iCAFs. Major T cell exclusion mechanism in PDAC via CXCR4 signaling (Elyada 2019, Ogawa 2021).</body>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <SimBiology xmlns="http://www.mathworks.com">
            <Unit Numerator="nanomolarity"/>
          </SimBiology>
        </annotation>
      </species>
      <species id="mw7d757aa6_741f_4dcc_9209_9df4b66a4820" name="IL6" compartment="mw026862eb_87b1_405a_b373_64e65f51ca39" initialConcentration="0" substanceUnits="MWDERIVEDUNIT_nanomolarity_milliliter" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="false" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Interleukin-6 inflammatory cytokine secreted by iCAFs. Promotes MDSC recruitment, M2 polarization, tumor progression.</body>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <SimBiology xmlns="http://www.mathworks.com">
            <Unit Numerator="nanomolarity"/>
          </SimBiology>
        </annotation>
      </species>
      <species id="mw1e35789a_5c7c_4d07_ac1d_cda2cb6dcccb" name="IL1" compartment="mw026862eb_87b1_405a_b373_64e65f51ca39" initialConcentration="0" substanceUnits="MWDERIVEDUNIT_nanomolarity_milliliter" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="false" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Interleukin-1alpha in tumor compartment. Tumor-derived; drives iCAF formation via NF-kB/LIF/JAK-STAT3. TGFb antagonizes signaling by downregulating IL-1R1.</body>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <SimBiology xmlns="http://www.mathworks.com">
            <Unit Numerator="nanomolarity"/>
          </SimBiology>
        </annotation>
      </species>
